Milestone 1 (Recreate ZAP environment with Vivado tools)
--------------------------------------------------------
1. Installing and Santity Checking
   a. Install Vivado (You may need to add Vivado path to .bashrc i.e. put "source /tools/Xilinx/Vivado/2024.2/settings64.sh" in 
      .bashrc)
   b. https://github.com/srvedulageth/solar_femtoTx.git
   c. cd solar_femtoTx
   d. make runsim TC=uart
   e. make syn 

2. Changing Address Ranges
   a. Change in zap_soc.v
   b. Change in src/tc/<testcase>/<testcase.s> and <testcase.h>
3. Instantiated EthMac from https://github.com/freecores/ethmac.git

Milestone 2(Running a simulation in Soc (with ZAP Core) and implementing in Artix basic communication)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Git
   -- git clone https://github.com/srvedulageth/solar_femtoTx.git
   -- cd solar_femtoTx/
   -- git branch //Should show that you are in main branch.
   -- git checkout solar_femtoTX_ms2 //Checks out solar_femtoTX_ms2
2. src/testbench/README 
3. src/testbench/syn/README 
4. Commands to run .c/.s/.h files

\rm -rf obj
mkdir -p obj/ts/ethmac_zap/
arm-none-eabi-as -march=armv5te -g   src/ts/ethmac_zap/uart.s   -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/uart_start.o
arm-none-eabi-gcc -c -msoft-float -mfloat-abi=soft -march=armv5te -ffreestanding -g -O2 -Isrc/ts/ethmac_zap   src/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.c     -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.o
arm-none-eabi-gcc -c -msoft-float -mfloat-abi=soft -march=armv5te -ffreestanding -g -O2 -Isrc/ts/ethmac_zap   src/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_demo.c     -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_demo.o
arm-none-eabi-gcc -c -msoft-float -mfloat-abi=soft -march=armv5te -ffreestanding -g -O2 -Isrc/ts/ethmac_zap   src/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_irq.c     -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_irq.o
arm-none-eabi-gcc -c -msoft-float -mfloat-abi=soft -march=armv5te -ffreestanding -g -O2 -Isrc/ts/ethmac_zap   src/ts/ethmac_zap/uart_shim.c      -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/uart_shim.o
arm-none-eabi-gcc -c -msoft-float -mfloat-abi=soft -march=armv5te -ffreestanding -g -O2 -Isrc/ts/ethmac_zap   src/ts/ethmac_zap/uart.c           -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/uart.o
arm-none-eabi-gcc -nostartfiles -nostdlib -Wl,-T,src/ts/common.ld -Wl,--gc-sections   obj/ts/ethmac_zap/uart_start.o   obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.o   obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_demo.o   obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_irq.o   obj/ts/ethmac_zap/uart_shim.o   obj/ts/ethmac_zap/uart.o   -Wl,--start-group -lc -lgcc -lnosys -Wl,--end-group   -Wl,-Map,obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.map   -o obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.elf

arm-none-eabi-objcopy -O binary obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.elf obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.bin
hexdump -ve '1/4 "%08x\n"' obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.bin > obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.dump

arm-none-eabi-objdump -d obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.elf //Creates Object Dump ...
5. ./run_cmd this will run all the above commands and generate obj/ts/ethmac_zap/ethmac_zap.dump
